1 Install Python

  Download and install from:
  👉 https://www.python.org/downloads/windows/
  
  During installation:
  ☑ Check “Add Python to PATH”
  ☑ Choose Customize → pip included

python --version
pip --version

2  Copy your project

Get your project onto Windows:

git clone ...
or

copy zip and extract

Go into project folder:
  cd ContractLabourProject

3  Create virtual environment
    python -m venv winenv
    winenv\Scripts\activate
   (winenv) C:\ContractLabourProject>

4  Install dependencies
   pip install -r requirements.txt
   pip install pyinstaller 

   pyinstaller --version

5  Build the Windows .exe
    pyinstaller desktop\launcher.py --name ContractLabourApp --onefile --noconsole

    After a minute you will get:
      dist\ContractLabourApp.exe

6. Test the exe
    Double-click:
       dist\ContractLabourApp.exe

7. Prepare install folder
    Create folder: ContractLabourApp-Windows
        Inside it put:
           ContractLabourApp.exe
            README.txt
Example README.txt:
   1. Extract this zip
   2. Double-click ContractLabourApp.exe
   3. No installation required

8. Zip for delivery
   Right click folder → Send To → Compressed (zipped) folder
    ContractLabourApp-Windows.zip


